{
  "name": "blocks",
  "about": "The content blocks side by side: a level-1 heading, a row section of two cards (icons, badges, an owner and a status), a loose card and a loose sticky to pick up, a callout, badges in three variants and labelled icons. The WEB e2e runs make a card with C and a section over two cards with S here.",
